{"slug":"deploy-static-site-with-ali-oss","title":"使用阿里云OSS部署你的静态站点","date":"2021-07-08","tags":["OSS","Deploy"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"使用阿里云OSS部署你的静态站点","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>使用阿里OSS部署静态站点，保持访问速度的情况下，最小化站点维护成本</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"背景\">背景</h2>\n<p>已知的很多免费静态站点部署方式，例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>github pages<br>\n国内访问速度极其慢</li>\n<li>gitee pages<br>\n目前gitee pages已经关闭开通，官方声称在维护中</li>\n<li>阿里云OSS静态站点方案<br>\n阿里云OSS对象存储的价格相对购买服务器来说较为划算<br>\n以40G资源包为例（<strong>40G为最小的资源包购买单位</strong>）：<br>\n40G/3年：30RMB左右</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>警告：访问流量额外计费</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>资源包仅可用作存储空间费用<br>\n站点浏览的流量是另计费，如果站点访问量并不是很大，总体上一定比单独购买服务器划算<br>\n如果站点访问量比较大，还是自购服务器比较合适</p>\n<p>并且40G的容量意味着可以部署非常多的静态站点，比如此篇博客更新后本站点的大小在5M左右</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>警告</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>更多的站点意味着更高的访问流量，请确保了解后果</p>\n<p>本站点就是部署在OSS上，以下步骤也为亲身实践得出，希望可以帮到有需要的人</p>\n<h2 id=\"阿里云对象存储oss介绍\">阿里云对象存储OSS介绍</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.aliyun.com/product/oss\">阿里云对象存储官网</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"准备工作\">准备工作</h2>\n<h3 id=\"购买域名\">购买域名</h3>\n<p>域名可以在阿里云上购买或者其他平台均可</p>\n<h3 id=\"https证书申请可选\">https证书申请（可选）</h3>\n<p>如果不需要https访问站点，则不需要这项工作</p>\n<h3 id=\"开通oss并新建bucket\">开通OSS并新建Bucket</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>注册阿里云账号</li>\n<li>开通OSS服务</li>\n<li>购买资源包</li>\n<li>新建bucket</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>新建的Bucket需要设置成<strong>公共读</strong>权限</p>\n<h3 id=\"对bucket进行一些必要设置\">对Bucket进行一些必要设置</h3>\n<h4 id=\"静态托管\">静态托管</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>点击基础设置 -> 静态页面</li>\n<li>设置默认首页，例如本站点设置的是<code>index.html</code></li>\n<li>设置文件404规则，本站点采用<a href=\"https://vuepress.vuejs.org/zh/\">Vuepress(v1)</a>开发，vuepress使用了<a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\">vue-router</a>作为spa路由<br>\n所以此项配置需要设置为：<code>index.html</code><br>\n不同的站点则需要根据情况设置404页面</li>\n<li>开通子目录首页，文件404规则设置为<code>Index</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"域名绑定\">域名绑定</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>增加域名的CNAME解析，解析值为<code>[bucket].[region]</code></li>\n<li>点击传输管理 -> 域名管理</li>\n<li>将域名绑定到bucket上</li>\n<li>上传的https证书（如果有需要的话）</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>详细步骤可以参考<a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/31872.html\">阿里云官方静态托管文档</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"部署\">部署</h2>\n<h3 id=\"手动部署\">手动部署</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>进入阿里云OSS控制台</li>\n<li>找到需要部署的bucket，点击进入</li>\n<li>点击上传文件</li>\n<li>将需要部署的所有文件全部上传至bucket中</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"自动部署\">自动部署</h3>\n<p>本人写了一个小工具，可以快速清空bucket并上传你的静态站点文件<br>\n使用前置条件是需要阿里云RAM用户的AccessKey ID和AccessKey Secret<br>\n详情可以参考<a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/product/28625.html\">阿里云RAM文档</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>安装</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"deploy-ali-oss-npm\">deploy-ali-oss-npm</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> ali-oss-static-web-deploy</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"deploy-ali-oss-yarn\">deploy-ali-oss-yarn</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">yarn</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> ali-oss-static-web-deploy</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"deploy-ali-oss-demo\">deploy-ali-oss-demo</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> aliOSSStaicWebDeploy</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">ali-oss-static-web-deploy</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">aliOSSStaicWebDeploy</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  region</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Your region</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  accessKeyId</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Your access key</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  accessKeySecret</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Your access key secret</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  bucket</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Your bucket name</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  staticWebAppPath</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\"> '</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">Your local path to deploy</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> // for example: require('path').resolve(process.cwd(), 'dist')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">})</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">js</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>注意</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>该工具会在清空bucket之后将<code>staticWebAppPath</code>中的所有文件上传至bucket中</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考\">参考</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aliyun.com/product/oss\">阿里云对象存储官网介绍</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://vuepress.vuejs.org/zh/\">Vuepress(v1)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\">vue-router</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/31872.html\">阿里云官方静态托管文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/product/28625.html\">阿里云RAM文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Blackman99/ali-oss-static-web-deploy\">ali-oss-static-web-deploy</a></li>\n</ul>","related":[{"slug":"vue-mixin-usage","title":"Vue2中的mixin使用方式小结","date":"2021-12-23","tags":["Vue"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"Vue2中的mixin使用方式小结","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"next-generation-css-utils-tailwindcss","title":"下一代前端样式开发工具库——Tailwindcss","date":"2021-09-24","tags":["Tailwindcss","CSS"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"开发业务页面时的利器","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"vite-typescript-ssr-redux-react","title":"Vite + typescript + redux + react + Hooks + SSR的使用","date":"2021-08-23","tags":["React","Redux","Typescript","SSR"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"Vite + typescript + redux + react + Hooks + SSR的使用","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}